  "obligations_version": 1,
  "_comment": "Obligations (M16a, §46; D-064). A shift, a class, an errand, with a lateness window and a real consequence. `gated_by_tags`/`gated_by_attrs` make an obligation impossible once the body changes past it — a transformation that gates a life task. The subject's obligation is `obl.subject.work`.",
